## Why This Is Asked
This question probes practical prompt budgeting, multilingual handling, and safety, plus lightweight prototyping.

## Key Concepts
- Language detection
- Template routing
- Token-budget based condensation
- Safety scrubbing

## Code Example
```javascript
// Minimal JS prototype for prompt condensation and routing
function condense(prompt, lang='en', budget=60){
  // naive token estimate by spaces
  const tokens = prompt.trim().split(/\\s+/);
  const trimmed = tokens.length > budget ? tokens.slice(0,budget).join(' ') + '...' : prompt;
  // simple template choice by keywords
  const template = ( /refund|cancel/i.test(prompt) ? 'concise' : 'empathetic');
  return {template, prompt: trimmed};
}
```

